5771-25/39031495_582094936911306_6800017255329826407_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_tG67tAD-0oQ7kNvwFbRezI&_nc_oc=AdrLeCVQdrCu2d32Tvb1rCrwwU6_vuJQEce-uF_om5qm4btt3C2r-Dcv1eTMPg5nfy4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT-zRlz9Z62oT73uoTCUdSO9_2OsO9fBr3-BokZhVOtBg&oe=6B0328E3"}, "display_name": "Archery Land", "keywords": [], "long_description": "You became a warrior who was called by the goddess to protect the shrine of water. \nAs evening approaches, monsters aiming for the Shrine of Water appear.\n\nWarrior! \n\nPass 6 ordeals to protect the shrine of water from monsters.  And become a legendary warrior who protects the shrine of water and protects the goddess by killing monsters! \n\nAlso, Be the greatest warrior in a breathtaking 1v1 battle with other warriors in the arena of Archery Land.", "short_description": "Archery Land is a single, multiplayer VR shooting game, and Enjoy the thrilling feeling of hitting the target in our Archery Land by aiming the bow at the wide land.\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Cover-MiniLandscape.png", "id": "1094889764444935", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974655_1094889767778268_3491009783949024005_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iR-3ccWyd7gQ7kNvwG1A8gL&_nc_oc=Adoo6UIPDFYS2FLRFYo47bEuEwuAVwZUcj1ONmhHzvdlo89D4Ijfi4qF-Zhjj3OvJrE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSpHdbb3V6gVfHL7DJDNlnE80SR2f_V3SEbGhEGz7J9sg&oe=6B032581"}, {"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "1038643100096859", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974716_1038643103430192_688937563710773948_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gYMCV7BatXoQ7kNvwE6uczm&_nc_oc=AdojWlIvg0scPgl-eIHAGVv3KW-zDVfipVhzqGJ0zy6qz8uEDM3QAtPjx5s1gs2KHrM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht